# Potential Persistence Via Microsoft Office Startup Folder | T1137 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/file/file_event/file_event_win_office_startup_persistence.yml
source="WinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational" EventCode=11 (((TargetFilename="*\\Microsoft\\Word\\STARTUP*" OR (TargetFilename="*\\Office*" TargetFilename="*\\Program Files*" TargetFilename="*\\STARTUP*")) (TargetFilename IN ("*.doc", "*.docm", "*.docx", "*.dot", "*.dotm", "*.rtf"))) OR ((TargetFilename="*\\Microsoft\\Excel\\XLSTART*" OR (TargetFilename="*\\Office*" TargetFilename="*\\Program Files*" TargetFilename="*\\XLSTART*")) (TargetFilename IN ("*.xls", "*.xlsm", "*.xlsx", "*.xlt", "*.xltm")))) NOT (Image IN ("*\\WINWORD.exe", "*\\EXCEL.exe"))
